      "body": "Hello teacher!\nCan you draw my CP?\n\n[CP] ICHIRO x ALEX \nGuard x Emperor / Moon x Sun\n\nAlex (受け, 185 cm) \n- The emperor of a kingdom. A selfless leader who is driven by the greater good.  \n- From afar, he’s bright and warm. Up close, he’s a force of nature. Life-giving, but also burning and overwhelming. \n- Someone who feels very strongly. Due to his position, he often has to commit cruel but necessary acts, which causes him to feel guilt and anger towards himself.\n- Note the tan skin, gold-coloured eyes, and the burn scar on one side of his body. He has a handsome face.\n- Motif: gold, blazing fire, burning sun.  \n\nIchiro (攻め, 185 cm) \n- A killer who works in secret for the emperor. \n- Hardworking and simple. He’s unremarkable, but impossible to ignore once noticed.\n- Amoral at the core but is perceptive enough to know what others want of him. He plays the role of a kind and considerate person around those he cares for.\n- He is detached from the emotions and ideals but secretly craves attachment and a place to belong in.\n- Note the dark blue hair and sea-coloured eyes. He has a kind face.\n- Motif: tranquil sea, clear sky, moon.  \n\nDespite being exact opposites, Alex and Ichiro are partners.  To Ichiro, Alex is a beacon. His guiding light. To Alex, Ichiro is an anchor. His grounding force.\nThey have a push-pull dynamic. For example, Ichiro likes to tease Alex and Alex always reciprocates it with a fond but helpless smile. \n\nFeel free to draw them in any outfit, pose, and composition!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/17yFTaERams_KJGxf45L7RyH4zJirRB9d",
